#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="src/main/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- Kotlin 1.9+ (fill in exact version)
- JVM 21 LTS
- Gradle with Kotlin DSL — do not use Groovy DSL for new projects

BUILD:
- ./gradlew build
- ./gradlew detekt for lint
- ./gradlew ktlintCheck for formatting

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- ktlint enforced — do not hand-format
- Detekt rules enforced — suppress only with @Suppress and a comment
- Prefer data classes for value objects
- Prefer sealed classes/interfaces for exhaustive state modeling
- Coroutines for async — no raw threads except for interop
- Null safety: use Kotlin's type system; avoid !! except in tests

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No !! (non-null assertion) in production code
- No System.out.println() — use a logger (SLF4J or kotlin-logging)
- No companion object singletons with mutable state
- No hardcoded secrets in source

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: generated code, build output, etc.)
